 "check": {
  "describe": "360x480: Today's orders, a muted summary, four divided rows: package icon, customer, items, a total; a chevron at the end. 480x200: two columns. 320x160: two rows under the heading, 'N items' beside it when they do not all fit, and the list scrolls. 160x160: no lead icons and no chevrons, customer and total only. n 0: heading and 'No orders yet'. A tap opens the row's note under it; nothing touches.",
